  "description": "Temporary fix for dotnet/runtime#135090: a Blazor WebAssembly app whose browser cached an error (503, 404, empty response) for a fingerprinted boot resource never boots again, even after a hard reload. Reference this package and a failed force-cache boot fetch is retried once with cache: \"reload\" (integrity kept). No code changes needed.",
